+---
+id: task-004-hourly-equipment-rental
+type: task
+title: "Hourly equipment rental"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Hourly equipment rental
+
+`addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (euro cents, a non-negative integer): what one hour of rental costs. A rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour is priced at the item's hourly price for each hour; the long-stay discount does not apply. An item without an hourly price cannot be rented by the hour: `quote` and `book` refuse it. Rentals of a day or more still start and end at midnight UTC and are priced per day. Hourly bookings take part in the overlap check like any other.
